WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.972 --> 00:00:03.241
DOWN.

00:00:01.273 --> 00:00:04.009
CORRESPONDENT GRIFF JENKINS HAS

00:00:03.608 --> 00:00:06.445
BEEN THERE ALL DAY.

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:08.280
GOOD EVENING.

00:00:06.578 --> 00:00:10.849
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, BRET.

00:00:08.413 --> 00:00:11.983
THIS APPEARS TO BE A CASE OF A

00:00:10.982 --> 00:00:13.552
SYSTEM WORKING RIGHT.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.655
SHERIFF CAMERON SAYS THE MOTIVE

00:00:13.685 --> 00:00:18.256
ISN'T CLEAR JUST QUITE YET, BUT

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:19.091
HE PAINTED A PICTURE OF A PRIOR

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:24.029
RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN THE

00:00:19.224 --> 00:00:25.831
DECEASED GUNMEN, AUSTIN WYATT

00:00:24.162 --> 00:00:26.364
RAWLINS, HE 17, AND A FEMALE

00:00:25.964 --> 00:00:29.034
STUDENT WHO IS 16.

00:00:26.498 --> 00:00:31.036
SHE IS IN INTENSIVE CARE AT A

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:32.671
LOCAL HOSPITAL AT THIS HOUR,

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:35.307
FIGHTING FOR HER LIFE.

00:00:32.804 --> 00:00:36.708
THE SECOND SHOOTING VICTIM, A

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.209
14-YEAR-OLD MALE STUDENT, IS IN

00:00:36.842 --> 00:00:39.377
STABLE CONDITION.

00:00:37.342 --> 00:00:41.980
THE SHERIFF DETAILING HOW THIS

00:00:39.511 --> 00:00:44.750
ALL UNFOLDED EARLIER TODAY AND

00:00:42.114 --> 00:00:48.353
THE BRAVE ACTIONS OF THAT SCHOOL

00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:48.954
RESOURCES OFFICER, DEPUTY

00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:52.057
SHERIFF BLAINE GASKILL.

00:00:49.087 --> 00:00:53.658
&gt;&gt; DFC BLAINE GASKILL FIRED AT

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.694
THAT SHOOTER AND WHAT IS

00:00:53.792 --> 00:00:57.763
DESCRIBED TO ME ALMOST SIMON

00:00:55.827 --> 00:00:59.631
SIMULTANEOUSLY, THE SHOOTER

00:00:57.896 --> 00:01:01.666
FIRED.

00:00:59.765 --> 00:01:02.434
&gt;&gt; NOW, BLAINE GASKILL SAYS IT

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.804
WILL BE FURTHER INVESTIGATION TO

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:08.206
DETERMINE WHETHER OR NOT IT WAS

00:01:05.937 --> 00:01:11.443
HIS SHOT THAT KILLED THE GUNMAN.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:12.611
THE FACT REMAINS, BRET, THAT YET

00:01:11.576 --> 00:01:16.448
AGAIN, WE'VE HAD SOMEONE OPEN

00:01:12.744 --> 00:01:17.849
FIRE IN ONE OF OUR SCHOOLS IN

00:01:16.581 --> 00:01:19.050
2018, AND MARYLAND'S GOVERNOR,

00:01:17.983 --> 00:01:21.987
LARRY HOGAN, SAYS HE IS OUTRAGED

00:01:19.184 --> 00:01:25.390
THAT MORE ISN'T BEING DONE.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:26.158
&gt;&gt; NO PARENT SHOULD EVER HAVE TO

00:01:25.524 --> 00:01:28.927
WORRY ABOUT WHEN THEY SEND THEIR

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:29.995
KIDS OFF IN THE MORNING TO

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.231
SCHOOL WHETHER THEY WILL COME

00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:35.033
HOME SAFELY OR NOT.

00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:37.235
AND WE NEED MORE THAN PRAYERS.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:37.836
I WANT TO THINK THESE

00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:38.570
FIRST RESPONDERS AND LAW

00:01:37.969 --> 00:01:40.138
ENFORCEMENT OFFICERS FOR THE JOB

00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:43.208
THEY DID BUT WE NEED MORE.

00:01:40.272 --> 00:01:45.076
WE NEED TO TAKE ACTION.

00:01:43.341 --> 00:01:48.213
&gt;&gt; JUST FOR A LITTLE CONTEXT, IT

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:48.980
WAS ONE WEEK AGO TOMORROW THAT

00:01:48.346 --> 00:01:52.284
THE STUDENTS HERE AT GREAT MILLS

00:01:49.514 --> 00:01:53.685
HIGH SCHOOL BEHIND ME WALKED OUT

